01:01:02.000 --> 01:01:13.370
<v Ira Glass>Thanks, as always, to our program's co-founder, Mr. Torey Malatia. While on lockdown these last few weeks, he's been working on his relationship. His wife has an old Al Green record that they like to snuggle to.
<v Ira Glass>像往常一样感谢我们节目联合创始人托里·马拉蒂亚先生。在过去几周的封锁中，他一直在经营他的关系。他的妻子有一张他们喜欢依偎着听的老艾尔·格林唱片。

01:01:13.370 --> 01:01:16.850
<v Esther Perel>It's an accelerator. It's a relationship accelerator.
<v Esther Perel>这是一种催化剂，一种关系催化剂。

01:01:16.850 --> 01:01:21.850
